art by sending a train to a nearby planet.","reward":1000,"timeLimit":null,"deadline":null,"status":"completed","acceptedSd":829.0542842981042,"completedSd":829.1147268095732,"ironUnlockedSnapshot":false,"sourcePlanetId":null,"targetPlanetId":null,"scientistSourceIds":null,"hazmatIncineratedSnapshot":0,"_routeBtnClicked":true,"_trainRouted":true,"_trainArrivedAtTarget":true,"visitedSnapshot":[88]},{"id":"create_route","name":"Create a repeating train route","imageType":"route_preview","imageKey":null,"objectives":[{"id":"sel_lava_start","text":"CLICK on the LAVA PLANET (or a TRAIN orbiting that planet) to select a starting point for your ROUTE","done":true},{"id":"shift_orijen","text":"SHIFT+CLICK on ORIJEN (your HOME PLANET) to ADD A STOP to your route","done":true},{"id":"shift_desert","text":"SHIFT+CLICK on the DESERT PLANET to ADD ANOTHER STOP to your route","done":true},{"id":"shift_loop","text":"SHIFT+CLICK on the LAVA PLANET to complete the LOOP ROUTE","done":true},{"id":"assign_route","text":"ASSIGN this ROUTE to a TRAIN","done":true}],"details":"A repeating route keeps your trains busy automatically — no need to redirect them after each delivery.","reward":2000,"timeLimit":null,"deadline":null,"status":"completed","acceptedSd":829.1576178313327,"completedSd":829.1792469054835,"ironUnlockedSnapshot":false,"sourcePlanetId":null,"targetPlanetId":null,"scientistSourceIds":null,"hazmatIncineratedSnapshot":0,"_routeAssigned":true,"visitedSnapshot":[88,87]},{"id":"build_foundry","name":"Build a Foundry","imageType":"foundry","imageKey":null,"objectives":[{"id":"station_foundry_planet","text":"Construct a STATION on a DESERT PLANET","done":true},{"id":"construct_foundry","text":"Construct a FOUNDRY on a DESERT PLANET","done":true}],"details":"Establish a foundry to smelt molten ore into refined iron.","reward":10000,"timeLimit":null,"deadline":null,"status":"completed","acceptedSd":829.1941361276109,"completedSd":829.2143571833672,"ironUnlockedSnapshot":false,"sourcePlanetId":null,"targetPlanetId":null,"scientistSourceIds":null,"hazmatIncineratedSnapshot":0,"visitedSnapshot":[]},{"id":"produce_iron","name":"Produce Iron","imageType":"car","imageKey":"car_iron","objectives":[{"id":"produce_iron_obj","text":"Produce [Iron] by delivering both [Molten Ore] and [Water] to a FOUNDRY","done":true}],"details":"Put your new foundry to work smelting raw ore into refined iron.","reward":10000,"timeLimit":null,"deadline":null,"status":"completed","acceptedSd":829.2407852976993,"completedSd":829.410694315694,"ironUnlockedSnapshot":false,"sourcePlanetId":null,"targetPlanetId":null,"scientistSourceIds":null,"hazmatIncineratedSnapshot":0,"visitedSnapshot":[88,87]},{"id":"upgrade_station","name":"Upgrade a Station","imageType":"station_large","imageKey":null,"objectives":[{"id":"deliver_4_iron_for_upgrade","text":"Deliver 4 [Iron] to a planet with a station you’d like to upgrade","done":true},{"id":"upgrade_to_large_station","text":"Upgrade a Station to a Large Station","done":true}],"details":"Stations only allow one train (in low orbit) to load or unload at a time, while a Large Station can accommodate trains in two orbits.","reward":50000,"timeLimit":null,"deadline":null,"status":"completed","acceptedSd":829.4159685608324,"completedSd":830.4118628312046,"ironUnlockedSnapshot":true,"sourcePlanetId":null,"targetPlanetId":null,"scientistSourceIds":null,"hazmatIncineratedSnapshot":0,"visitedSnapshot":[88,87,50025,89]},{"id":"buy_second_train","name":"Buy a 2nd train","imageType":"car","imageKey":"engine_galaxy","objectives":[{"id":"open_trains","text":"Press \"T\" to open the \"Trains\" window","done":true},{"id":"open_builder","text":"Press the \"+\" sign to open the Train Builder","done":true},{"id":"purchase_train","text":"Purchase a new train with 2+ [Iron] cars","done":true},{"id":"deliver_iron_orijen","text":"Using your new TRAIN, load [Iron] from the DESERT PLANET and deliver it to ORIJEN","done":true}],"details":"A rail empire can't grow with a single engine! Buy a second train and set up a second route to diversify your revenue.","reward":15000,"timeLimit":null,"deadline":null,"status":"completed","acceptedSd":829.4275995346127,"completedSd":830.006004263268,"ironUnlockedSnapshot":true,"sourcePlanetId":null,"targetPlanetId":null,"scientistSourceIds":null,"hazmatIncineratedSnapshot":0,"_ironFromDesertToOrijen":1,"visitedSnapshot":[88,87,50025,89]},{"id":"dispose_hazmat","name":"Dispose of Hazmat","imageType":"car","imageKey":"car_hazmat","objectives":[{"id":"incinerate_hazmat","text":"Incinerate 2.0 units of [Hazmat]","done":true}],"details":"Industrial activity produces Hazmat as a by-product. As Hazmat accumulates on a planet, it drags down the planet's productivity & its people's happiness. Pick up Hazmat from a planet with Hazmat cars & transport it to the nearest star for incineration.","reward":8000,"timeLimit":null,"deadline":null,"status":"completed","acceptedSd":829.9556645212544,"completedSd":830.519840935545,"ironUnlockedSnapshot":true,"sourcePlanetId":null,"targetPlanetId":null,"scientistSourceIds":null,"hazmatIncineratedSnapshot":0,"visitedSnapshot":[88,87,50025,89]},{"id":"mad_scientist","name":"A Mad Scientist","imageType":"car","imageKey":"engine_classJ","objectives":[{"id":"pickup_scientist","text":"Send a TRAIN equipped with a [Passenger Car] to pick up the Mad Scientist (1 unit of [Passengers]) from Miriondor","done":false},{"id":"deliver_scientist","text":"Deliver the Mad Scientist back to ORIJEN","done":false}],"details":"A Mad Scientist on Miriondor has requested a meeting with the CEO of Drexler's Quasar Bound. He claims to have designed a Space Train Engine with longer range, better acceleration, and a higher top speed than even the top-of-the-line GALAXY CLASS engines — and he wants to discuss it in person.","reward":null,"timeLimit":null,"deadline":null,"status":"active","acceptedSd":830.6977067620414,"completedSd":null,"ironUnlockedSnapshot":true,"sourcePlanetId":13,"ta